	(text "Sheet: MCU\n\nPurpose: RP2040 core: flash, crystal, USB data, SWD, boot/reset\n\nPlanned contents:\n  - U: RP2040, decoupling per RP2040 hardware design guide\n  - U: W25Q16JVUXIQ 2 MB QSPI flash\n  - Y: ABM8-272-T3 12 MHz crystal + load caps\n  - USB D+/D- with 27R series resistors\n  - BOOTSEL and RESET, SWD test points\n  - I2C bus(es) and SPI0/SPI1 pins out to the other sheets"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
